  · change ‖v 14‖ ≤ ‖v‖
    exact norm_le_pi_norm v 14
  · change ‖v 15‖ ≤ ‖v‖
    exact norm_le_pi_norm v 15
  · change ‖v 16‖ ≤ ‖v‖
    exact norm_le_pi_norm v 16
  · change ‖v 17‖ ≤ ‖v‖
    exact norm_le_pi_norm v 17
  · change ‖v 18‖ ≤ ‖v‖
    exact norm_le_pi_norm v 18
